 raw基本F1 | accepted基本F1 | raw关联F1 | accepted关联F1 | raw严格F1 | accepted严格F1 |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| 窄规则 | 8.89% | 8.89% | 0% | 0% | 0% | 0% |\n| Qwen3-32B-4bit | 30.19% | 34.04% | 18.87% | 21.28% | 15.09% | 17.02% |\n| DeepSeek-v4-pro | 72.34% | 72.34% | 57.45% | 57.45% | 53.19% | 53.19% |\n\nF1不等于准确率；accepted不等于可用或人工确认。46条accepted金额全部仍有主体/期间关联警告。工程款、资产变价、法院收款误当工资实收等语义错误，以及保守误警、真实OCR/明确零/明确部分应付/真实同额多事件覆盖缺口均列入ERROR_REVIEW，不能据此训练或自动采用金额。\n\n应用最后本地完整检查：1789 Vitest/46文件、8895 runtime通过/1平台跳过、材料67通过/1平台跳过。独立44项双Node原样红→绿，HTTP410通过、411份raw不变、409份重启快照与cleanup通过；HTTP明确使用合成模型输出。fa77 CI曾因测试ready JSON半写读取失败，原日志、未执行步骤和后续原子发布修复全部保留；没有靠重跑旧CI掩盖。实验ROOT类型/静态检查、v26实际write/check、独立工具/评分复核均通过，最终精确提交完整CI以Checks和后续验收回执为准，尚未冒称成功。\n\n交付入口：`experiments/material-facts-v7/ISSUE42_ACCEPTANCE.md`；详细协议、逐案结果与原始证据见本目录README、ANNOTATION、ERROR_REVIEW及ROUND36_V26_LIGHT_INDEPENDENT。测试、隔离HTTP、CI、模型小样本评测与人工业务验收分别记录。PR45/46未合并，Issue42保持打开；未训练或部署生产。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T04:35:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T18:16:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6a152650be2e66e2f840e62c4e58d601666eb108","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/46/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/46/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/46/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/statuses/770bd26b1ed3723dcc8a85ebf25d78a8df5a94bf","head":{"label":"ZZZZihan:feature/material-facts-v7-comparison","ref":"feature/material-facts-v7-comparison","sha":"770bd26b1ed3723dcc8a85ebf25d78a8df5a94bf","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon